OL,3,GNEWSATeen drove at about 90mph before
OL,4,Afatal river crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage driver who died along with a
OL,7,Fpassenger when his car plunged into a
OL,8,Friver had been speeding at about 90mph
OL,9,F(145km/h) moments before the crash, an
OL,10,Finquest heard.
OL,12,FDeclan Berry, 18, had been driving four
OL,13,Ffriends along North Brink on 17 March
OL,14,Fwhen his VW Polo entered the River Nene
OL,15,Fnear Wisbech in Cambridgeshire. His
OL,16,Fbody was recovered two weeks later.
OL,18,FAt an inquest into his death held in
OL,19,FHuntingdon, coroner Elizabeth Gray
OL,20,Fconcluded he died as a result of
OL,21,Fdrowning.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
