OL,3,GNEWSATeen drove at about 90mph before
OL,4,Afatal river crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree passengers survived and, via a
OL,7,Fstatement read in court, one of them
OL,8,Fsaid Berry had been driving at about
OL,9,F90mph moments before the incident, and
OL,10,Fwhen he asked him to "slow down", Berry
OL,11,Freplied "we will be fine".
